{
  "_id": "tg-partake",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "I did go forth and partake, 1 Ne. 8:11. Adam and Eve had partaken of the forbidden fruit, 2 Ne. 2:19. they shall not partake of his salvation, 2 Ne. 26:24. partake of the goodness of God, Jacob 1:7. partake of his salvation, Omni 1:26. partake of the waters of life, Alma 42:27 (D&C 10:66). not suffer any one knowingly to partake of my flesh and blood unworthily, 3 Ne. 18:28. see that ye partake not of the sacrament of Christ unworthily, Morm. 9:29. meet together oft to partake of bread and wine, Moro. 6:6 (D&C 20:75).",
